(7594414, 1224948, 61396, '<td valign="top">thanks for sharing the things you see</td>', 'thanks for sharing the things you see', '2018-08-30 04:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594415, 1224763, 61396, '<td valign="top">well framed</td>', 'well framed', '2018-08-30 04:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594416, 1224619, 61396, '<td valign="top">nicely imagined</td>', 'nicely imagined', '2018-08-30 04:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594417, 1224882, 61396, '<td valign="top">nice illustration of the far and the deep</td>', 'nice illustration of the far and the deep', '2018-08-30 04:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594477, 1224909, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even without the meteors this would be an exciting image.  Though a lighthouse is for guidance and warning, here it feels more like aspiration, to the stars and beyond.  And what a nice set of meteors, kindly disposing themselves for this composition.  I''m also charmed by the telephone lines stretching from the mainland (I''m supposing) to this tiny island, which now seems, itself, to be taking its own tentative first step into the beyond.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Even without the meteors this would be an exciting image.  Though a lighthouse is for guidance and warning, here it feels more like aspiration, to the stars and beyond.  And what a nice set of meteors, kindly disposing themselves for this composition.  I''m also charmed by the telephone lines stretching from the mainland (I''m supposing) to this tiny island, which now seems, itself, to be taking its own tentative first step into the beyond.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-08-30 12:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594479, 1224882, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m honestly not sure whether I''m looking at the sky or a lovely reconsideration.  Please pardon my confusion.  In any case, it''s a stellar summary of what an idealized version, real or not, looks like --   a multitude of stars, comets, meteors, a galaxy, a nebula and the Star of Bethlehem.  Delicate and satisfying.</td>', 'I''m honestly not sure whether I''m looking at the sky or a lovely reconsideration.  Please pardon my confusion.  In any case, it''s a stellar summary of what an idealized version, real or not, looks like --   a multitude of stars, comets, meteors, a galaxy, a nebula and the Star of Bethlehem.  Delicate and satisfying.', '2018-08-30 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594480, 1224604, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific extended image capturing numerous meteors, their reflections and, as icing, the Milky Way.  The orange glow over the hills, also reflected, adds depth of time.  Elicits the feeling of a flurry of action amidst eternity.<br/>Is this Parker Lake in Arizona?  If so, and even if not, it brings back fond memories of gallivanting across the country in my early twenties, searching out this isolated dot on the map.  Still can''t believe that I was able to hitchhike to and then out of there.  Thank you for that.</td>', 'Terrific extended image capturing numerous meteors, their reflections and, as icing, the Milky Way.  The orange glow over the hills, also reflected, adds depth of time.  Elicits the feeling of a flurry of action amidst eternity.Is this Parker Lake in Arizona?  If so, and even if not, it brings back fond memories of gallivanting across the country in my early twenties, searching out this isolated dot on the map.  Still can''t believe that I was able to hitchhike to and then out of there.  Thank you for that.', '2018-08-30 12:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594482, 1224763, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine take on the challenge, focusing on what isn''t there.  I like the extended sky, nicely graduated, above the relatively narrow strip of rooftop vents and machinery.  The vents seem to be avidly searching out meteors, to no avail at the moment.  It also appears to be an outpost on a distant planet.</td>', 'Fine take on the challenge, focusing on what isn''t there.  I like the extended sky, nicely graduated, above the relatively narrow strip of rooftop vents and machinery.  The vents seem to be avidly searching out meteors, to no avail at the moment.  It also appears to be an outpost on a distant planet.', '2018-08-30 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594483, 1224948, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, a close-up of a meteor trail and its shadow beneath a cloud, lit from below, as I see it.  The background is interesting.  I like the texture of the path, reminiscent of a string hung in sugar water, weighted by a paper clip, the sugar starting to crystallize onto it.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge, a close-up of a meteor trail and its shadow beneath a cloud, lit from below, as I see it.  The background is interesting.  I like the texture of the path, reminiscent of a string hung in sugar water, weighted by a paper clip, the sugar starting to crystallize onto it.', '2018-08-30 13:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594485, 1224554, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, the brilliant meteor flashing across the upper right corner, almost an afterthought.  Of course it''s not, but it feels like a reminder that yes, the world is full of wonder.  The glow of the Milky Way adds a subtle diagonal to the image.  The trees work well as foreground, establishing scale and perspective.</td>', 'Interesting composition, the brilliant meteor flashing across the upper right corner, almost an afterthought.  Of course it''s not, but it feels like a reminder that yes, the world is full of wonder.  The glow of the Milky Way adds a subtle diagonal to the image.  The trees work well as foreground, establishing scale and perspective.', '2018-08-30 13:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594487, 1224458, 173844, '<td valign="top">This looks like a futuristic battlefield, fending off an alien invasion alluded to in the title.  The choice of featuring a wind tower perfectly suits the sci-fi vibes.  Also, there''s a gleeful feel to it, a joy in this visual playground.  Fun image.</td>', 'This looks like a futuristic battlefield, fending off an alien invasion alluded to in the title.  The choice of featuring a wind tower perfectly suits the sci-fi vibes.  Also, there''s a gleeful feel to it, a joy in this visual playground.  Fun image.', '2018-08-30 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594488, 1224864, 173844, '<td valign="top">The meteors captured are nice and jaunty.  Unfortunately, an over-abundance of light compromises the sweep of the sky.  Cities make it tough to feature the goings-on in the heavens above, as I can sympathize with you, living in New York City.  Next year, let''s ask the mayor to shut them off for a night.</td>', 'The meteors captured are nice and jaunty.  Unfortunately, an over-abundance of light compromises the sweep of the sky.  Cities make it tough to feature the goings-on in the heavens above, as I can sympathize with you, living in New York City.  Next year, let''s ask the mayor to shut them off for a night.', '2018-08-30 13:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594508, 1224909, 185714, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. Great exposure. I smelled ribbon.</td>', 'Lovely capture. Great exposure. I smelled ribbon.', '2018-08-30 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7594509, 1224458, 185714, '<td valign="top">interesting compo.</td>', 'interesting compo.', '2018-08-30 22:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
